      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW ALIA (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish 1.3 lengths away in third (20.39) at Traralgon in a Mix 6/7 over 350m. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. PAW VITALI (7) jumped from this same draw and was close to the lead throughout before boxing on well and holding a second (22.52) at Warrnambool over 390m in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win. Worth another try. ARIZONA ICON (3) found trouble in the run here last time and failed to finish before going for a five-and-a-half months spell. Has the ability and can atone with the right run. PAW MINTY (6) cannot be left out despite racing here for the first time.",
